  :issued nil :published (2017 11 24) :published-uri "https://www.veritaszim.net/node/2284" :published-in "Supplement to the Zimbabwean Government Gazette dated 24 November 2017" :in-force (2017 11 24) :dates-note "The SI copy shows no signature date; only the gazette supplement date." :summary "Declares 21 February every year henceforth a public holiday, the Robert Gabriel Mugabe National Youth Day (s.2(2)). First observed 2018-02-21. Called 'National Youth Day' in the lists from 2021.")
